Cell["\<\
The causal future of an event at height 3, drawn from the sorted vertex list \
the sampler returns, on the diamond lattice, a sprinkling into \
two-dimensional Minkowski space and the cylinder lattice.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"b1da1638-bc66-4d7f-a1b3-5195aeebe1f1"],

